From fca037cb1601f9196d3b22ad1aac4d4982a3d3e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seongmincho315 <seongmin.cho@genon.ai>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 11:18:36 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix: address code review feedback on Parallel node

- Merge parent iterationContext instead of overwriting it, so nested
  containers (e.g. Parallel inside Iteration) keep $iteration resolution
- Preserve existing parentNodeId when tagging branch executed data,
  needed for nested container scenarios
- Recover partial execution data from a rejected branch promise so
  failed branches still show up in the execution log
- Check both iterationIndex and branchIndex when matching parents in
  the execution tree builder (ExecutionDetails, AgentExecutedDataCard)
- Simplify ParallelNode resizing to percentage-based CSS dimensions,
  removing the manual dimension-tracking state/effect

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
